Windows: build with MinGW (clang/gcc) toolchains as well as MSVC.

- Spell defines -DFOO: cl.exe accepts both /D and -D, GNU-style drivers only -D.
- Add -l<lib> next to -DEFAULTLIB:<lib>.lib; each linker ignores the other form.

